silm:instances_papers_19_mereology_as_colimit_chapters_08_cheese_and_failure_modes_sections_04_forbidden_shortcut_catalog_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In 'ForbiddenShortcutCatalogYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, In 'Forbidden-Shortcut Catalog', the cocone_factorisation arrow witnesses a typed leg between Mittens and VetCarePlan_77 under the mereology-as-colimit law of the Mittens cocone with cocone-compatibility triangle closure.; also, In 'Forbidden-Shortcut Catalog', the evidence_witness arrow witnesses a typed leg between VetRecord and Mittens under the mereology-as-colimit law of the Mittens cocone with cocone-compatibility triangle closure." .
